# libimud export list — the Darwin counterpart of lib/libimud.map.
#
# Apple's linker has no --version-script and no symbol versioning at all, so
# the SONAME/version-node half of the map has no equivalent here; what carries
# over is the `local: *` half, which keeps everything but the public API out of
# the dynamic symbol table.
#
# A wildcard rather than the eleven names, so this file cannot drift out of
# step with the map.  What holds it together is the rule that every exported
# symbol is imud_-prefixed, which tools/check-libimud-api.py asserts against
# the map's global: lists.
_imud_*
